{"id":"n15819-1-5","stage":2,"title":"바퀴 · 圈","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15819-1-5-1","ko":"뭐 찾으시는 거 있으세요? 도와드릴까요?","zh":"需要找什么吗？需要我帮忙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾으시는","meaning":"拜访，寻访，探访","explanation":"찾다：拜访，寻访，探访；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"5","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으세요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도와드릴까요?","meaning":"帮，帮助；(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"拜访，寻访，探访","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了见某人或看某地而去相关场所。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a58830c0e125fc338bb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15819-1-5-2","ko":"괜찮아요. 그냥 한 바퀴 둘러볼게요.","zh":"不用了，我随便逛逛就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아요.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바퀴","meaning":"圈，周","explanation":"바퀴：圈，周","readings":[{"term":"바퀴","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15819","senseId":"1","lemma":"바퀴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘러볼게요.","meaning":"环视，环顾","explanation":"둘러보다：环视，环顾；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"둘러보다","audio":"/audio/040d6724c4a643c6e173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61340","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘러보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"c8e16f13560a8ff4","term":"바퀴","zh":"圈，周","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3","entryId":"15819","definition":"计算画圈一样绕着一个圆形转动次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["바퀴"]},{"id":"040d6724c4a643c6","term":"둘러보다","zh":"环视，环顾","audio":"/audio/040d6724c4a643c6e173.mp3","entryId":"61340","definition":"到处查看周边。","pronunciation":["둘러보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dce861a6e1f1058366a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.215,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15819","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.8126,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不用了，我随便逛逛就好。","家里到处都散发着好闻的香气。","需要找什么吗？需要我帮忙吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不用了，我随便逛逛就好。","需要找什么吗？需要我帮忙吗？","家里到处都散发着好闻的香气。"],"answer":0}]}
